# One-off measurement/probe scripts (scripts/_*.mjs). These are throwaway tools
# written to MEASURE the design vs the live render (strand fitting, pill/logo
# alignment, stroke profiles, screenshot diffs). They are not part of the build
# and nothing at runtime imports them. The real build scripts (no underscore)
# stay tracked.
scripts/_*.mjs

# scratch diagnostic pages
_*.html
